1
00:00:00,039 --> 00:00:01,816
Siste sjanse til å få denne til

2
00:00:01,816 --> 00:00:02,720
redusert pris.

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,438
Akkurat nå koster den bare 899

4
00:00:04,438 --> 00:00:04,940
kroner.

5
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:06,859
Ordinær pris 1169 kroner.

6
00:00:06,859 --> 00:00:09,075
Dobbeltlinse, AI-sporing og hele

7
00:00:09,075 --> 00:00:10,579
355 graders dekning.

8
00:00:10,579 --> 00:00:12,650
Lageret er begrenset og prisen går

9
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:13,319
