10
00:00:13,319 --> 00:00:15,139
Handle i dag, betal med Klarna.

11
00:00:15,139 --> 00:00:16,665
Få den nå, betal senere.

12
00:00:16,665 --> 00:00:18,420
Fri frakt over 300 kroner.

13
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:20,167
30 dagers åpent kjøp hvis du ikke

14
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:20,749
